  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1001 GRANTS FOR SURFACE WATER TREATMENT, REGIONAL WATER SYSTEMS, AND GROUNDWATER INVESTIGATIONS",
  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART Env-Dw 1001 GRANTS FOR SURFACE WATER TREATMENT, REGIONAL WATER SYSTEMS, AND GROUNDWATER INVESTIGATIONS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nThis part was formerly designated Env-Ws 393 entitled Public Water Supply Grants. Document #8479, effective 11-30-05, readopted with amendments Env-Ws 393. This part was subsequently redesignated editorially with a new subtitle as Env-Dw 1001, entitled Grants for Surface Water Treatment, Regional Water Systems, and Groundwater Investigations, within a new Chapter Env-Dw 1000, entitled Grants for Public Water Systems, pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05. The numerals of the rules remained unchanged, and the source notes for the rules under Document #8479 refer to those numbers under the subtitle Env-Ws.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1000.html"
